flipoff-kiosk
=============

This project is a derivative work.

Original
--------

The split-flap rendering engine originates from FlipOff by magnum6actual:

    https://github.com/magnum6actual/flipoff

Released under the MIT license per that project's README ("MIT — do whatever
you want with it"). That repository ships no LICENSE file, so the MIT notice
in LICENSE is reproduced on its behalf.

Files originating upstream, kept essentially unchanged:

    static/js/Board.js
    static/js/Tile.js
    static/js/MessageRotator.js
    static/js/flapAudio.js
    static/js/SoundEngine.js
    static/js/KeyboardController.js
    static/css/*

    static/js/constants.js  — modified: grid dimensions and messages are read
                              at runtime from the backend instead of being
                              hardcoded

Added here
----------

    app/                    FastAPI backend, admin UI, persistent state
    static/js/kiosk-main.js backend-driven bootstrap
    Dockerfile
    openapi.json

